  displayName: Riposte
  description: 'Take a guard for a heartbeat. The first blow struck at you up close is turned aside and answered with a cut that stuns; against a foe too great to stun, the cut lands half again as hard. Arrows and bolts are not stopped. A clean parry returns half the cooldown; guarding at nothing leaves you open.'
